  "instructions": [
    "preheat oven to 180c.",
    "mix together porridge oats, vanilla extract, and a pinch of salt in a bowl.",
    "in a separate bowl, mix together dairy-free milk, honey, and grated cheddar cheese.",
    "add egg to the dairy-free milk mixture and whisk until smooth.",
    "add the dairy-free milk mixture to the oat mixture and stir until combined.",
    "add the score-fat and mix until crumbly.",
    "press the mixture into a baking dish and bake for 25 minutes.",
    "remove from oven and sprinkle with chocolate chips.",
    "return to oven for an additional 5 minutes, or until the chocolate is melted and bubbly.",
    "remove from oven and let cool for 5 minutes before serving."
  ],
